The same lists as exceptions.txtar evaluated with scope=selection: any @@
rule of any block list cancels every deny rule, as in AdGuard Home's merged
engine.

-- list ads block adblock --
||example.org^
@@||safe.example.org^
||tracker.example^
@@|tracker.example^
-- list other block adblock --
||safe.example.org^
||shared.example^
@@||shared.example^
-- options --
scope=selection
-- expect --
example.org               block ads ||example.org^
safe.example.org          allow ads @@||safe.example.org^
www.safe.example.org      allow ads @@||safe.example.org^
tracker.example           allow ads @@|tracker.example^
www.tracker.example       block ads ||tracker.example^
shared.example            allow other @@||shared.example^
